WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
The <00:00:00.140>Buddhist <00:00:00.440>texts <00:00:01.100>give <00:00:01.560>the <00:00:01.720>answer <00:00:02.140>in

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.520
a <00:00:02.640>single <00:00:02.980>line.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.100
As <00:00:04.340>a <00:00:04.460>solid <00:00:04.820>rock <00:00:05.160>is <00:00:05.500>not <00:00:05.700>shaken

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.060
by <00:00:06.420>the <00:00:06.580>wind, <00:00:07.760>wise <00:00:07.920>people <00:00:08.320>falter <00:00:08.820>not

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.580
amidst <00:00:09.420>blame <00:00:09.880>and <00:00:10.240>praise.
